    "replacement": "Residual Wealth Contribution \u2014 never ordinary labor income"
  },
  "central_question": "How much revenue can Arkansas raise from households with very high net worth while fully exempting ordinary homes, retirement security, working farms/small businesses below a protected threshold, and everyone dependent primarily on labor income?",
  "key_table_question": "If the remaining gap is $250M / $500M / $1B / $2B, what minimum wealth threshold and rate would close it while exempting the broadest possible share of Arkansas households?",
  "philosophy": {
    "name": "Residual Wealth Contribution",
